<title>USA: Ingersoll-Rand names Latam branch president.</title>
<headline>Ingersoll-Rand names Latam branch president.</headline>
<dateline>WOODCLIFF LAKE, N.J. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ingersoll-Rand Co said on Friday that it named Ernesto Ramon to the newly created position of president of Ingersoll-Rand Latin America.</p>
<p>Ramon joins Ingersoll-Rand from Dow Chemical Co where he worked for 30 years.</p>
<p>Ingersoll-Rand which is a Woodcliff Lake, N.J.-based firm manufactures air compressors, construction and mining equipment, bearings and precision components, tools, golf cars and light-utility vehicles, architectural hardware and industrial machinery.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
